DOC|subsystem_inference|v1|updated=2026-03-22a
META|inertia=MEDIUM|parent=architecture_root.dsb
META|files=cognition/inference_gateway.py,cognition/cloud_mode.py,cognition/reasoners/

DESIGN_POINTS|
  DP1|single entry point: InferenceGateway.reason() is the ONLY call site for all inference; no tier strings leak to callers
  DP2|from_env() instantiates all tier reasoners at boot; stored on Igor as self._gateway
  DP3|DAG routing for pipeline calls (preparse/winnow/NE/think) via gateway.call(purpose_id)
  DP4|tier cascade for interactive/background via gateway.reason(level, skip_to)
  DP5|cloud_mode gate: 3 conditions (env+balance+daytime); 5-min cache; _BALANCE_UNKNOWN sentinel prevents silent disable
  DP6|on_tier callback: fires at each tier attempt; main.py uses for activity broadcast
  DP7|skip_to computed by caller (milieu dominance + complexity); passed to gateway; phase 2 will move inside gateway
  DP8|local_only parameter: gateway returns graceful message without hitting any API
  DP9|D203: _log_err=None defined at top of reason() — was undefined, causing NameError to crash error handler when any tier failed; OR 400 assistant-prefill guard in _call_api(): if messages[-1].role==assistant, synthetic user nudge appended before POST

TIER_ROUTING|
  level=background_batch → pool.reason_batch() (local quality priority); return empty on fail
  level=background → cloud_active→t3/impulse else t2/impulse; return empty on fail (never blocks)
  level=interactive → cascade from skip_to: t3→t35→t4→t5(inhibited)→t6(arbiter)

SKIP_TO_SIGNALS|
  tier.3=low complexity + low milieu dominance
  tier.3.5=medium complexity OR all interactive (D035 floor)
  tier.4=high complexity OR milieu dominance escalation OR NE ambiguity

DAG_PURPOSES|preparse,winnow,ne,think
  preparse|local_preferred→ollama_preparse[fallback→or_preparse]|cloud_preferred→or_preparse
  winnow|local_preferred→ollama_winnow[fallback→or_winnow]|cloud_preferred→or_winnow
  ne|cloud_training→or_ne|ne_local_ok→ollama_ne[fallback→or_ne]|ne_purpose_extra:response_format=json_object
  think|always→ollama_think (no cloud fallback)

REASONERS|
  t2=OllamaReasoner(qwen2.5:7b)|OLLAMA_LOCAL_MODEL
  t3=OpenRouterReasoner(gpt-4o-mini)|OPENROUTER_CHEAP_MODEL
  t35=OpenRouterReasoner(claude-haiku-4.5)|OPENROUTER_DEFAULT_MODEL
  t4=OpenRouterReasoner(claude-sonnet-4-6)|OPENROUTER_INTERACTIVE_MODEL
  t5=AnthropicReasoner|IGOR_TIER5_ENABLED=false (inhibited)

CLOUD_MODE|
  file=cognition/cloud_mode.py|cached 5min|invalidate_cache() on .env reload
  condition1=IGOR_CLOUD_TRAINING_ENABLED=true
  condition2=OR balance≥IGOR_CLOUD_BUDGET_FLOOR_USD(default $10)
  condition3=local hour 06:00-22:59
  balance_unknown=-1.0 sentinel; network error→assume funded; never silently disable

CLOUD_OK_OVERRIDE|D071
  file=~/.TheIgors/cloud_ok_override.json|TTL-based|set by PROC_SET_CLOUD_NOW or learn_about(now)
  functions=is_cloud_ok_override(),set_cloud_ok_override(ttl_hours=4.0),clear_cloud_ok_override()
  InferenceContext.cloud_ok_override=True (default); set in make_context(); False=night/local-only mode
  gates=_cloud_ok() + _cloud_preferred() block background calls when cloud_ok_override=False
  interactive_turns=unaffected (cloud always OK for human conversation)

AGENTIC_TURNS|IGOR_MAX_TURNS env; 0=unlimited (for reading sessions); default 8; D187
KNOWN_FAILURES|F003(IMPULSE_SKIP),F004(cloud-mode-disabled),F005(tier-model-inversion),F006(gateway-attr-error)
DECISIONS|D015,D023,D025,D026,D031,D032,D033,D034,D035,D039,D040,D041,D053,D071,D187,D188,D206

COLOCATION_SIGNAL|T-inference-colocation-signal|live=2026-03-22a|D205
  purpose=deprioritize local Ollama when it shares a box with the Postgres DB (avoids RAM contention)
  detection=InferenceContext.db_colocated=True when IGOR_HOME_DB_URL contains localhost/127.0.0.1 or is empty (SQLite)
  routing=_local_preferred() returns False when db_colocated=True; cloud path taken instead
  lives-in=inference_gateway.py (InferenceContext dataclass + _local_preferred + _make_inference_context)
